        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"context\":[{\"id\":\"c1\",\"text\":\"Total selling and administrative expense | 3,989 | 3,783 | 5 | % | | 3,684 | 3 | % | |\"},{\"id\":\"c2\",\"text\":\"Other segment items | (14) | (2) | — | | | (9) | — | | |\"},{\"id\":\"c3\",\"text\":\"EARNINGS BEFORE INTEREST AND TAXES | $ | 5,376 | $ | 4,735 | 14 | % | | $ | 5,822 | -19 | % | |\"},{\"id\":\"c4\",\"text\":\"FISCAL 2026 COMPARED TO FISCAL 2025\"}],\"filing\":\"NKE 10-K\",\"section\":\"Part II Item 7\",\"sentences\":[{\"id\":\"s1\",\"section_path\":\"Part II Item 7 > FISCAL 2026 COMPARED TO FISCAL 2025\",\"text\":\"North America revenues increased 5% on a currency-neutral basis.\"},{\"id\":\"s2\",\"section_path\":\"Part II Item 7 > FISCAL 2026 COMPARED TO FISCAL 2025\",\"text\":\"Wholesale revenues increased 14% including expanded distribution, higher shipments to existing partners and fewer marketplace management actions taken in the current year.\"},{\"id\":\"s3\",\"section_path\":\"Part II Item 7 > FISCAL 2026 COMPARED TO FISCAL 2025\",\"text\":\"NIKE Direct revenues decreased 6% due to declines in digital sales of 10% and declines in store sales of 2%.\"},{\"id\":\"s4\",\"section_path\":\"Part II Item 7 > FISCAL 2026 COMPARED TO FISCAL 2025\",\"text\":\"Comparable store sales decreased 2%.\"},{\"id\":\"s5\",\"section_path\":\"Part II Item 7 > FISCAL 2026 COMPARED TO FISCAL 2025\",\"text\":\"Footwear revenues increased 5% on a currency-neutral basis.\"},{\"id\":\"s6\",\"section_path\":\"Part II Item 7 > FISCAL 2026 COMPARED TO FISCAL 2025\",\"text\":\"Unit sales of footwear increased 6%, while lower ASP per pair reduced footwear revenues by approximately 1 percentage point.\"},{\"id\":\"s7\",\"section_path\":\"Part II Item 7 > FISCAL 2026 COMPARED TO FISCAL 2025\",\"text\":\"Lower ASP per pair was primarily due to channel mix, partially offset by product mix and strategic pricing.\"},{\"id\":\"s8\",\"section_path\":\"Part II Item 7 > FISCAL 2026 COMPARED TO FISCAL 2025\",\"text\":\"Apparel revenues increased 4% on a currency-neutral basis.\"},{\"id\":\"s9\",\"section_path\":\"Part II Item 7 > FISCAL 2026 COMPARED TO FISCAL 2025\",\"text\":\"Unit sales of apparel increased 2%, while higher ASP per unit contributed approximately 2 percentage points of apparel revenue growth.\"},{\"id\":\"s10\",\"section_path\":\"Part II Item 7 > FISCAL 2026 COMPARED TO FISCAL 2025\",\"text\":\"Higher ASP per unit was primarily due to product mix, partially offset by channel mix.\"},{\"id\":\"s11\",\"section_path\":\"Part II Item 7 > FISCAL 2026 COMPARED TO FISCAL 2025\",\"text\":\"Reported EBIT increased 14% reflecting higher reported revenues and the following: •Gross margin expansion of 210 basis points primarily due to lower product costs, lower warehousing and logistics costs driven by channel mix, and higher ASP. Higher ASP primarily reflects strategic pricing and product mix, partially offset by channel mix. •Demand creation expense increased 6% primarily due to higher sports marketing expense. •Operating overhead expense increased 5% primarily due to higher wage-related expense.\"},{\"id\":\"s12\",\"section_path\":\"Part II Item 7 > FISCAL 2026 COMPARED TO FISCAL 2025\",\"text\":\"EMEA revenues decreased 3% on a currency-neutral basis.\"},{\"id\":\"s13\",\"section_path\":\"Part II Item 7 > FISCAL 2026 COMPARED TO FISCAL 2025\",\"text\":\"Wholesale revenues were flat.\"},{\"id\":\"s14\",\"section_path\":\"Part II Item 7 > FISCAL 2026 COMPARED TO FISCAL 2025\",\"text\":\"NIKE Direct revenues decreased 9% due to declines in digital sales of 10% and declines in store sales of 8%.\"},{\"id\":\"s15\",\"section_path\":\"Part II Item 7 > FISCAL 2026 COMPARED TO FISCAL 2025\",\"text\":\"Comparable store sales decreased 7%.\"}]}"
